SUMMARY:NOAA CPC long-lead seasonal outlook release: December 2026 forecast
 \, seasons DJF 2026 to DJF 2027
DESCRIPTION:CPC states the forecast is generally released around 8:30 AM Ea
 stern Time on the scheduled date\, on the third Thursday of the month. CPC
  says its 2027 schedule will be released on or about 2 December 2026. Sche
 dule as published at https://www.cpc.ncep.noaa.gov/products/predictions/sc
 hedule.php (read 10 November 2026). The SEASONAL desk on indahl.ai: https:
 //indahl.ai/seasonal
URL:https://www.cpc.ncep.noaa.gov/products/predictions/schedule.php
